    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "What the discharge paperwork covers:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " the ED diagnosis; imaging or test results from the visit; the follow-up plan with a provider outside the ED (eg, PCP, specialist); return precautions (when to come back); medications prescribed or changed; written in a language the patient understands."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Written and verbal:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " verbal instructions alone aren't enough; patients then misunderstand their diagnosis, care plan and return precautions."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Check understanding:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " assess whether the patient understood their discharge instructions, and ask if they have questions."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Refused treatment:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " the record must describe the exam or treatment that was refused; take all reasonable steps to get a written informed refusal showing the patient was told the risks and benefits."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
